<title>CHINA: Citibank sets warrants on basket of bank stocks.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on basket of bank stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Bank, N.A. Hong Kong Branch said Friday it launched 600 million American style call warrants on a basket of bank stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings		  0.01 shares</p>
<p> Ka Wah Bank		    0.07 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$3.711	PREMIUM	  22.96 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.0852     GEARING	  4.36x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	15.AUG.97     MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 15.JUN.98     LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$3.711	LISTING DATE   04.SEPT.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
